menu "Sugarat Wi-Fi provisioning"

config SUGARAT_WIFI_MAX_TX_POWER_DBM
    int "Maximum Wi-Fi transmit power (dBm)"
    range 2 20
    default 20
    help
        Limit radio transmit power before scans and saved-network reconnects.
        Select a value verified on the target board and power supply. The
        Wi-Fi driver maps this limit to its supported power levels.

endmenu
